    "title": "kungfu city fighting game",
    "description": "Do you want to feel the power of speed superheroes and want to give a real hard time to gangster squad and criminals? If yes then enjoy this amazing flash superhero fighting games 2024. This game brings you to the streets of New Vegas full of gangsters. The crime lords of the new Vegas city are again in power returning with mafia be a real superhero flash while fighting with gangsters. This is realistic heroic ultimate superhero flash battle of Superhero flash in new Vegas of gangster enemies in super city rescue games.\r\n\r\nIn this game superhero is trained hard to fighting with special kung fu and karate move throwing knifes on gangster to kill the gangsters. You have to move fast to finish off the bad boys gangsters force to prove your self real speed  superhero.You are the fastest flash speedster robot hero and you have to protect the citizens of Vegas city. Became a light hero or speed hero of super hero games in Vegas city. Choose your favourite flash superhero and play like incredible super speed hero games and fictional speed hero game. Fight like a super fighting hero and act like a professional fighter, be a legend of heroes with super speed light hero. This Vegas city crime simulator is developed integrating all the best features of kungfu fighting games, super flash games, robots games, and superhero games. Explore the crime city, full of gangs in this game become citizen's hope as a standard of justice and don\u2019t let these criminals and monster hero rule over the Vegas City.\r\n\r\nExplore the crime city and don\u2019t hesitate to accept any mission. Their is multiple missions are in game which you to have fight with great kungfu fighting skills. You are the owner of a special technique of combat and incredible strength and agility to get rid of the real gangster mafia in best ninja hero game. The main mission of flash superhero is survival against gangsters to complete all levels of game.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s a best city rescue game we recommend all of the fighting lovers and city rescue lovers to come and play this action game. You have  superheroes you can call them super hero squad. This hero game consist of unique features :\r\n- Incredible combos. You'll be the best in this fighting game!\r\n- Perfect kung fu and karate kicks can be played\r\n- Different scenarios to fight.\r\n- Free game\r\n- Full of action and thrill\r\n- It's FUN!",
